<stack-static>
    <statement><p><p><m>\mathbf{a} = {\left(\begin{array}{c} -4 \\ 6 \\ 2 \end{array}\right)}</m>. For each vector, choose whether it is parallel to <m>\mathbf{a}</m> in the same direction, parallel in the opposite direction, or not parallel.</p><div><m>{\left(\begin{array}{c} -12 \\ 18 \\ 6 \end{array}\right)}</m>: [ parallel, same direction | parallel, opposite direction | not parallel ]  </div><div><m>{\left(\begin{array}{c} -16 \\ 24 \\ 8 \end{array}\right)}</m>: [ parallel, same direction | parallel, opposite direction | not parallel ]  </div><div><m>{\left(\begin{array}{c} 12 \\ -18 \\ -6 \end{array}\right)}</m>: [ parallel, same direction | parallel, opposite direction | not parallel ]  </div><div><m>{\left(\begin{array}{c} 8 \\ -12 \\ -5 \end{array}\right)}</m>: [ parallel, same direction | parallel, opposite direction | not parallel ]  </div></p></statement>
    <solution><p><p>One vector is parallel to another when it is a number times the other, the same number for every component. Divide each component by the matching component of <m>\mathbf{a}</m>.</p><ul><li><m>{\left(\begin{array}{c} -12 \\ 18 \\ 6 \end{array}\right)}</m>: the ratios are <m>{3}</m>, <m>{3}</m>, <m>{3}</m>. Each is <m>{3}</m>, so the vector is <m>{3}\mathbf{a}</m>: parallel, same direction.</li><li><m>{\left(\begin{array}{c} -16 \\ 24 \\ 8 \end{array}\right)}</m>: the ratios are <m>{4}</m>, <m>{4}</m>, <m>{4}</m>. Each is <m>{4}</m>, so the vector is <m>{4}\mathbf{a}</m>: parallel, same direction.</li><li><m>{\left(\begin{array}{c} 12 \\ -18 \\ -6 \end{array}\right)}</m>: the ratios are <m>{-3}</m>, <m>{-3}</m>, <m>{-3}</m>. Each is <m>{-3}</m>, so the vector is <m>{-3}\mathbf{a}</m>: parallel, opposite direction.</li><li><m>{\left(\begin{array}{c} 8 \\ -12 \\ -5 \end{array}\right)}</m>: the ratios are <m>{-2}</m>, <m>{-2}</m>, <m>{-\frac{5}{2}}</m>. They are not all equal, so it is not parallel to <m>\mathbf{a}</m>.</li></ul></p></solution>
    <answer><p>parallel, same direction</p></answer>
    <answer><p>parallel, same direction</p></answer>
    <answer><p>parallel, opposite direction</p></answer>
    <answer><p>not parallel</p></answer>
</stack-static>